#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remote access"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title #
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remote access（Tunnel + 应用 Token）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> 通过 **Cloudflare Tunnel** 将家里 PC 上的 Hub 暴露到公网时，由 Hub **`remote_auth`** Bearer Token 保护非本地连接。\n"
"> 安全上下文：[`security.md`](security.md) · 安装：[`install.md`](install.md)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "概览"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| 层                    | 作用                                                                                                          |\n"
"| --------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **Hub `remote_auth`** | `config.yaml` 明文 token；REST `Authorization: Bearer`；SAP `connect` 帧 `auth_token`；MCP `/mcp` 同样 Bearer |\n"
"| **cloudflared**       | 出站隧道；Hub hostname → `127.0.0.1:2658`，Web hostname → `127.0.0.1:2659`（可选）                            |\n"
"| **客户端设置**        | app/desktop / app/mobile / **浏览器 Web** 在 **Hub 设置页**填写 Hub 地址与 token                              |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:19
msgid ""
"仅当 **Host 为 loopback**（`127.0.0.1` / `localhost` / `::1`）**且 TCP 对端也"
"为 loopback** 时 **不验 token**（本地开发、CLI/systemd 探活）。公网域名（经 "
"Tunnel）、局域网 IP 等访问时须带 token；与 `tunnel.enabled` 无关。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Hub 配置"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:23
msgid ""
"在 `~/.anima/config.yaml` 中设置（**仅本地使用可省略**；暴露到局域网或公网前"
"必须配置）："
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:24
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"remote_auth:\n"
"  token: \"请替换为 openssl rand -base64 32 生成的随机串\"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:30
msgid "生成示例："
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "openssl rand -base64 32\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:36
msgid ""
"`.gitignore` 已忽略 `config.yaml`；请勿提交到 git。Admin API 读配置时会对 "
"`remote_auth.token` 脱敏显示。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Tunnel（可选）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:39
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"anima tunnel setup\n"
"anima service start\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:45
msgid ""
"`tunnel.enabled: true` 时随 **`anima service start`** stack 启动 cloudflared"
"（不再使用独立 `anima-tunnel.service`）。Ingress 默认指向本机 Hub `:2658`；若"
"配置 `tunnel.web_hostname` 与 `web.enabled`，第二条 ingress 指向 Web "
"`:2659`。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:46
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"tunnel:\n"
"  enabled: true\n"
"  hostname: anima.example.com\n"
"  web_hostname: app.anima.example.com\n"
"\n"
"web:\n"
"  enabled: true\n"
"  port: 2659\n"
"  public_url: https://app.anima.example.com\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "若不使用 Tunnel，局域网可分别访问 `http://<PC-IP>:2658`（Hub）与 `:2659`（Web）；客户端在设置页填写 Hub 地址与 token。\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cloudflare 凭证（pass）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:66
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| pass 路径                                | 用途                     |\n"
"| ---------------------------------------- | ------------------------ |\n"
"| `services/cloudflare/api-token`          | 创建 Tunnel / DNS        |\n"
"| `services/cloudflare/tunnel-credentials` | `cloudflared` 连接器凭证 |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:68
msgid "详见向导 `anima tunnel setup`。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. 客户端配置"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:72
#, no-wrap
msgid "**app/desktop**、**app/mobile** 与 **浏览器 Web**（`web.enabled` + Tunnel 或局域网 `:2659`）均视为远端客户端，**不读取** Hub 的 `config.yaml` token。\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:78
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| 客户端      | 存储位置                                     |\n"
"| ----------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| app/desktop | `~/.anima-desktop/settings.json`（`hub` 段） |\n"
"| app/mobile  | Capacitor Preferences                        |\n"
"| 浏览器 Web  | localStorage（设置页）                       |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:80
msgid ""
"桌面调试与 Sentry 配置在同一文件的 `debug` 段；可用环境变量 "
"`FREEANIMA_DESKTOP_HOME` 覆盖目录（默认 `~/.anima-desktop`）。若存在旧版 "
"`~/.anima/shell-client.json`，首次启动会自动迁移。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:82
msgid "设置项（两端一致）："
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:85
msgid ""
"**Hub 地址** — 如 `https://anima.example.com`（Web UI 与 Hub 分域名时填 "
"**Hub** hostname，非 Web UI 域名）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:85
msgid "**远程 Token** — 与 Hub `remote_auth.token` 相同"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:87
msgid ""
"浏览器 Web：`/config.json` 可提示默认 Hub（来自 `tunnel.hostname`）；首次访问"
"仍须在设置页保存 token。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:89
msgid ""
"操作：打开 Hub 设置 → 填写 → **测试连接** → 保存。桌面端保存后需 **重启 app/"
"desktop**。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:90
#, no-wrap
msgid "4. 认证行为"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:92
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"REST:  Authorization: Bearer <token>\n"
"SAP:   WebSocket /sap/v1 → connect 帧含 auth_token 字段\n"
"MCP:   POST/GET /mcp → Authorization: Bearer <token>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:98
#, no-wrap
msgid "5. MCP 出站（外部 Agent 查询 Hub 数据）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:101
msgid ""
"Hub 在 **`/mcp`** 提供 Streamable HTTP MCP Server，暴露 ToolSet 中 "
"`expose_mcp: true` 的只读查询工具（如 `memory_recall`、"
"`conversation_search`）。外部 MCP Client（Cursor、Claude Desktop 等）可连接并"
"调用，**不经 LLM 中转**。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:102
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# 外部 agent 配置示例（Cursor mcp.json 等）\n"
"mcpServers:\n"
"  freeanima:\n"
"    url: http://127.0.0.1:2658/mcp\n"
"    headers:\n"
"      Authorization: \"Bearer <remote_auth.token>\"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:114
msgid ""
"**入站**（Hub 连接外部 MCP Server 并注册工具）：仍用 `config.yaml` 的 "
"`mcp_servers`（`capabilities/mcp-client`）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:114
msgid ""
"**出站**（外部 agent 调用 Hub 工具）：`/mcp` 端点（`capabilities/mcp-"
"server`）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:114
msgid ""
"公网 / 局域网访问须与 REST 相同携带 `remote_auth` token；loopback 直连可省略"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:116
msgid "缺少或错误 token → HTTP `401` 或 SAP 连接关闭。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:118
msgid ""
"判定依据为请求 URL 的 **Host**（经 Tunnel 时为公网域名，如 "
"`anima.example.com`）与 **TCP 对端地址**；Hub 不读取 `tunnel.enabled` 决定是"
"否验 token。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:119
#, no-wrap
msgid "运维命令"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:127
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| 命令                           | 说明                                              |\n"
"| ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `anima tunnel status`          | Tunnel / cloudflared 状态                         |\n"
"| `anima tunnel start` / `stop`  | 手动启停 cloudflared（生产由 service stack 托管） |\n"
"| `anima web start --foreground` | 独立 Web 静态服（调试）                           |\n"
"| `anima service status`         | Hub / Web / Tunnel stack                          |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:128
#, no-wrap
msgid "故障排查"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:137
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| 现象                   | 检查                                                       |\n"
"| ---------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| 公网 502               | Hub 是否运行？`anima service status`                       |\n"
"| 公网 1033              | `anima tunnel status` 中 `connected: no`                   |\n"
"| 401                    | 客户端 token 是否与 `remote_auth.token` 一致               |\n"
"| 本机开发正常、远程失败 | 远程请求是否带 Bearer / SAP auth_token；公网 Host 须 token |\n"
"| 改 token 后仍 401      | 更新 Hub config **并** 各客户端设置页                      |\n"
msgstr ""

